{"ref":"BDB, בִּלְהָה","hw":"בִּלְהָה","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">בִּלְהָה</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.f. (</strong>etym. dub.<strong>)</strong> handmaid of Rachel, concubine of Jacob <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:29\" href=\"/Genesis.29.29\">Gn 29:29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:3\" href=\"/Genesis.30.3\">30:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:4\" href=\"/Genesis.30.4\">4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:5\" href=\"/Genesis.30.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:7\" href=\"/Genesis.30.7\">7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:22\" href=\"/Genesis.35.22\">35:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 35:25\" href=\"/Genesis.35.25\">25</a> (sons Dan & Naphtali) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:2\" href=\"/Genesis.37.2\">37:2</a> (prob. gloss, Ol) <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:25\" href=\"/Genesis.46.25\">46:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 7:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.7.13\">1 Ch 7:13</a>.","next":"BDB, בִּלהָה","prev":"BDB, בַּלָּהָה"}